# Host simulator: a new message while the watch face is up raises the card;
# Later goes back, View opens that message in the reader.
raw cloud url usb:sim
goto CloudSettings
wait 600
tap 120 230
wait 7000
goto Watch
wait 2500
raw cloud fake say Are we still on for 6pm? Bring the cable
raw cloud check
wait 1500
expect screen CloudNotify
snap n1_card
tap 60 240
wait 600
expect screen Watch
raw cloud fake say Second one: running 10 min late
raw cloud check
wait 1500
expect screen CloudNotify
tap 180 240
wait 2000
expect screen InboxRead
expect log CLOUD:.*read\sid=m4 3000
snap n2_view
expect noerr
